{
  "slug": "gorealo-refinance-review",
  "name": "GoRealo — Refinance nurture",
  "description": "Subject: Does your current mortgage still fit? | Preheader: Compare the whole cost before considering a refinance.",
  "type": "email",
  "builder": "mailpurse",
  "html_content": "<!doctype html><html lang=\"en\"><head><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\"><title>Does your current mortgage still fit?</title></head><body style=\"margin:0;background:#f1f4f8;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\"><div style=\"display:none;max-height:0;overflow:hidden;mso-hide:all\">Compare the whole cost before considering a refinance.</div><table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"background:#f1f4f8\"><tr><td align=\"center\" style=\"padding:24px 12px\"><table role=\"presentation\" width=\"600\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"width:100%;max-width:600px;background:#fff\"><tr><td style=\"padding:24px 30px;border-top:5px solid #0BFF56\"><a href=\"https://www.gorealo.com/\"><img src=\"https://app.gorealo.org/email-template-previews/gorealo/gorealo-logo.png\" width=\"154\" alt=\"GoRealo\" style=\"display:block;width:154px;max-width:100%;height:auto;border:0\"></a><p style=\"margin:9px 0 0;color:#667085;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:1.5px\">MORTGAGE OPTIONS, MADE CLEAR</p></td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:30px;background:#f0f5ff\"><p style=\"margin:0 0 12px;color:#003FDA;font-size:11px;font-weight:bold;letter-spacing:2px\">A FRESH LOOK</p><h1 style=\"font-size:30px;line-height:1.2;margin:0 0 16px;color:#162849\">Your plans change. Your mortgage can be reviewed, too.</h1><p style=\"font-size:16px;line-height:1.7;color:#374151;margin:0 0 14px\">Hi {{first_name}}, a refinance may be worth exploring when your goals or finances change. The right comparison includes closing costs, the new payment, and how long you plan to keep the loan.</p><p style=\"font-size:16px;line-height:1.7;color:#162849;font-weight:bold;margin:0\">What would you most like a refinance to help you do?</p><p style=\"margin:20px 0 0\"><img src=\"https://app.gorealo.org/email-template-previews/gorealo/assets/loan-savings-math.png\" alt=\"GoRealo: Refinance nurture\" width=\"540\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;max-width:540px;height:auto;border:0;border-radius:8px\"></p></td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:22px 30px\"><table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\"><tr><td style=\"padding:14px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #e5eaf1\"><h2 style=\"font-size:17px;line-height:1.35;margin:0 0 7px;color:#162849\">Compare the break-even point</h2><p style=\"font-size:15px;line-height:1.75;color:#4b5563;margin:0\">Consider how upfront costs relate to any monthly difference and how long you expect to keep the new loan.</p></td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:14px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #e5eaf1\"><h2 style=\"font-size:17px;line-height:1.35;margin:0 0 7px;color:#162849\">Check APR, term, and total interest</h2><p style=\"font-size:15px;line-height:1.75;color:#4b5563;margin:0\">A payment change can come from a different loan term as well as a different rate.</p></td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:14px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #e5eaf1\"><h2 style=\"font-size:17px;line-height:1.35;margin:0 0 7px;color:#162849\">Use your current details</h2><p style=\"font-size:15px;line-height:1.75;color:#4b5563;margin:0\">Rates and eligibility depend on your loan, property, credit, and other factors.</p></td></tr></table><p style=\"font-size:15px;line-height:1.75;color:#374151;margin:22px 0\">Reply with your goal—lower payment, different term, or another reason—and we can help outline what to compare.</p><p style=\"font-size:15px;line-height:1.75;color:#374151\">Warmly,<br><strong>The GoRealo Team</strong></p><table role=\"presentation\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" style=\"margin:22px 0\"><tr><td bgcolor=\"#003FDA\" style=\"border-radius:4px\"><a href=\"https://www.gorealo.com/mortgage-rates/30-year-refinance/\" style=\"display:inline-block;padding:14px 24px;color:#fff;text-decoration:none;font-size:15px;font-weight:bold\">Review refinance rates</a></td></tr></table><p style=\"font-size:13px;line-height:1.7;color:#667085\">Prefer to talk? Call <a href=\"tel:+18667139292\" style=\"color:#003FDA\">1-866-713-9292</a> or reply to this email.</p></td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:20px 30px;background:#f4f6f9\"><p style=\"font-size:11px;line-height:1.7;color:#667085;margin:0\">GoRealo® is a DBA of Consumer Credit Services, LLC. NMLS #1070755 · Florida Mortgage Broker License #MBR1434.<br>5011 Gate Parkway Bldg 100, Suite 100, Jacksonville, FL 32256.<br>Equal Housing Opportunity. Credit, collateral, eligibility, and program terms apply.</p><p style=\"font-size:11px;line-height:1.7;color:#667085\"><a href=\"https://www.gorealo.com/privacy-policy/\" style=\"color:#003FDA\">Privacy</a> · <a href=\"{{unsubscribe_url}}\" style=\"color:#003FDA\">Unsubscribe</a></p></td></tr></table></td></tr></table></body></html>",
  "plain_text_content": "Does your current mortgage still fit? Compare the whole cost before considering a refinance. MORTGAGE OPTIONS, MADE CLEAR A FRESH LOOK Your plans change. Your mortgage can be reviewed, too. Hi {{first_name}}, a refinance may be worth exploring when your goals or finances change. The right comparison includes closing costs, the new payment, and how long you plan to keep the loan. What would you most like a refinance to help you do? Compare the break-even point Consider how upfront costs relate to any monthly difference and how long you expect to keep the new loan. Check APR, term, and total interest A payment change can come from a different loan term as well as a different rate. Use your current details Rates and eligibility depend on your loan, property, credit, and other factors. Reply with your goal—lower payment, different term, or another reason—and we can help outline what to compare. Warmly, The GoRealo Team Review refinance rates Prefer to talk? Call 1-866-713-9292 or reply to this email. GoRealo® is a DBA of Consumer Credit Services, LLC. NMLS #1070755 · Florida Mortgage Broker License #MBR1434. 5011 Gate Parkway Bldg 100, Suite 100, Jacksonville, FL 32256. Equal Housing Opportunity. Credit, collateral, eligibility, and program terms apply. Privacy · Unsubscribe",
